<p>While Furnace is on your armour is so hot from the furnace it dissipates parts of all energy based attacks against you.</p><p>All non physical, non mind damage is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17, 24, 31, 38, 45</acronym> (current <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17, 24, 31, 38, 45</acronym>).</p><p>Each turn this happens you gain a molten point (up to 10), decreasing the efficiency of the reduction by 25%.</p><p>Molten points are removed upon running or resting.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Hot liquid metal, the fun!</span></span></p><p></p>